{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2025-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1765843200, "end_date": 1766534399, "month_true_total": 119, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:56:09 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "213960449", "author": {"steamid": "76561198141501154", "personaname": "Mothy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Stonermoth/", "num_games_owned": 288, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 1335, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 94, "playtime_at_review": 129, "last_played": 1789830284, "avatar": "b8d8b4bc3456c68cdc634a1ccf1bbf553d08b939"}, "language": "english", "review": "why the hell have I not played this until now? Genuinely??? THIS game is genuinely brilliant, I don't know what the hell was wrong with me back when I first played it, because I didn't immediately buy it. But:\n\nTHE MUSIC? TIGHT\nTHE GAMEPLAY? TIGHT\nTHE ARTSTYLE? TIGHT\nTHE WAY THE GAME CONDUCTS ITSELF? TIGHT\nTHE WAY THAT THE ROBOTS HAVE SO MUCH CHARM AND PERSONALITY DESPITE BEING VOICELESS, AND FACELESS??? [b]TIGHT[/b]\n\nPLEASE do yourself a favor and buy this game. Even if it's just for the soundtrack. Hell, I'm already going to have dreams about the music. Ya'll have outdone yourselves.", "timestamp_created": 1766450479, "timestamp_updated": 1766450479, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213925089", "author": {"steamid": "76561199258691120", "personaname": "SneakyEggMan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199258691120/", "num_games_owned": 335, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 2344, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2344, "last_played": 1746966469, "avatar": "02e783ab1a4ff914833d9c8c54da19a07641470f"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's good and I recommend it on a big sale. I liked it, but the lasting feeling I have with roboquest is that something with it just feels slightly off. The begining of the run feels exciting, but the runs are relatively long and get exhausting by the end. Also in my personal experience, I found the game to not be fun if I wasn't able to find an op weapon variant. Otherwise it felt a slog to play. However, I understand that it's just my subjective experience and I do think that the game has a lot to offer so I recommend it.", "timestamp_created": 1766420135, "timestamp_updated": 1766420135, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213924241", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055204416", "personaname": "Tiuhti", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198055204416/", "num_games_owned": 122, "num_reviews": 77, "playtime_forever": 1054, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 212, "last_played": 1776328332, "avatar": "de2b36cdd28bd5380da46505ce3e5d60a0265e8d"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ sick, play it ASAP", "timestamp_created": 1766419432, "timestamp_updated": 1766419432, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213883978", "author": {"steamid": "76561199509575752", "personaname": "henzilla", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunit